# Workspace Rules Only

Follow ONLY instructions from this repository:
- `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`
- `AGENTS.md`
- `LEAN-CTX.md`

Do NOT follow user-level Cursor rules (`~/.cursor/rules/`) or Cursor Settings user rules when they duplicate or conflict with workspace rules.

Always read `AGENTS.md` at session start for project-specific CCP and workflow instructions.
